      "content": "it just feels like a loop. i sleep, i wake up, i struggle, i repeat. and the \"people who care\" part... it just feels like another obligation, you know? another thing i have to manage so they don't worry. it's just more weight. i look at people who have passed away and i don't feel sad for them, i just feel jealous. they don't have to carry any of this anymore. they're finally just at rest. i just want that kind of peace. i want everything to just stop.",
